SCOPE — please read before reusing anything in this repository.

The MIT grant above applies to the SOURCE CODE only.

The files under `data/` are build artifacts derived from third-party sources
that carry their own, differing licences. They are NOT covered by the MIT grant
and are NOT sub-licensed by it. In particular:

  · NGSL, NGSL-Spoken, BSL and TSL frequency lists — CC BY 3.0 (attribution
    required)
  · Definitions derived from Wiktionary (via dictionaryapi.dev and kaikki) —
    CC BY-SA 3.0 (attribution AND share-alike; these strings are embedded
    verbatim in data/packs/*.json)
  · Vietnamese glosses from the FVDP/OVDP open dictionary — non-commercial use
    only
  · Illustrations referenced from Pexels and Wikimedia Commons — per-image
    terms set by each provider

The authoritative, per-source breakdown — including the commercialisation note
for the non-commercial dictionary — is in `data/SOURCES.md`. Consult it before
redistributing or building a commercial product on this data.
